# Hansard model manifest - the ONLY place model provenance is declared.
#
# Format:  <target-path>|<url>|<sha256>|<archive-member>
#
#   <target-path>     path inside /models. It MUST match how the adapters
#                     resolve a local model:
#                       ASR   models_dir / model_id.replace("/", "__")
#                             (hansard.adapters.asr.registry)
#                       VAD   models_dir / "silero" / "silero_vad.onnx"
#                             (onnx_asr.models.silero._get_model_files)
#                       DIAR  the two constants in
#                             hansard.adapters.diarization.sherpa
#   <url>             direct download. https://huggingface.co is rewritten to
#                     $HF_ENDPOINT and https://github.com to $GITHUB_MIRROR so
#                     air-gapped builds pull from an internal mirror.
#   <sha256>          verified after download. A mismatch fails the build.
#   <archive-member>  optional. When set, the URL is an archive and only this
#                     member is extracted to <target-path>.
#
# Hugging Face URLs are pinned to a COMMIT, never to `main`, so a rebuild in
# six months produces the same bytes.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ASR - ONE model serves BOTH French and English.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6b v3 is natively multilingual (25 European languages,
# fr and en among them) and needs no language tag at inference time. That is
# why it was chosen: one 0.67 GB int8 artifact, one deployment, no per-language
# worker pool, ~2 GB RSS on CPU. Licence CC-BY-4.0 - see models.NOTICE.
nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3/config.json|https://huggingface.co/istupakov/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-onnx/resolve/8f23f0c03c8761650bdb5b40aaf3e40d2c15f1ce/config.json|666903c76b9798caf2c210afd4f6cd60b08a8dbf9800ec8d7a3bc0d2148ac466|
