#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Diarization - language independent, ~46 MB total.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Plain GitHub release assets: no Hugging Face token, no gated repo, no
# click-through licence. That is exactly what an air gap needs.
#
# The EMBEDDING model was chosen on measurement, not on reputation. Benchmarked
# on synthetic multi-speaker meetings with exact ground truth:
#
#   nemo_en_titanet_small.onnx     0.01 % speaker confusion   DER 14.96 %
#   3dspeaker_campplus_voxceleb    47 %   speaker confusion   DER 62.77 %
#
# CAM++ failed even when handed the correct number of clusters, so this is not
# a clustering-hyperparameter problem. Do not swap TitaNet out without
# re-running that benchmark. `embedding_model` is a setting and a Helm value
# (diarization.embeddingModel), so you can test a candidate without a rebuild -
# but the bundle ships the one that measured well.
sherpa-onnx-pyannote-segmentation-3-0/model.int8.onnx|https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/speaker-segmentation-models/sherpa-onnx-pyannote-segmentation-3-0.tar.bz2|24615ee884c897d9d2ba09bb4d30da6bb1b15e685065962db5b02e76e4996488|sherpa-onnx-pyannote-segmentation-3-0/model.int8.onnx
